<view class="page-safety-confirmation app-page app-page--padded"><top-bar title="安全确认"></top-bar><view class="page-safety-confirmation__safety-panel"><view class="page-safety-confirmation__title">先确认此刻是否安全</view><view class="page-safety-confirmation__description">你刚才的回答需要我们先确认当前状态。这里不会显示分数、历史记录、身份或模型内容。</view><view class="page-safety-confirmation__section-title">请选择最符合现在的情况</view><button class="page-safety-confirmation__safety-option" data-state="can_be_safe" bindtap="choose">我现在可以保证安全</button><button class="page-safety-confirmation__safety-option" data-state="uncertain" bindtap="choose">我不太确定</button><button class="page-safety-confirmation__safety-option page-safety-confirmation__safety-option--urgent" data-state="cannot_be_safe" bindtap="choose">我现在无法保证安全</button></view><state-message wx:if="{{error}}" title="确认未完成" message="{{error}}"></state-message><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="page-safety-confirmation__muted">正在保存当前选择…</view></view>
